WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
This is Overview. The menu on the left takes you everywhere.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Overview is the health of The Switch at a glance.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Analytics has The Switch's own numbers: visits, switches, and money moved to women-owned businesses.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The Switch is where most of the work happens: brands, products, brand checks and service providers.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The Switch Society opens the Society site.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Needs attention lists everything waiting on a person. The badge shows how many.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Switch outreach is where you contact brands.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Places holds local businesses that have applied.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Growth tracks growth work and the brands each person brought in.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
And Lists shows products, types and brands as searchable lists.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.500
Let's look at Overview.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Auto-publish shows whether ready products go live by themselves, and what published today.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Some controls are greyed out. The reason is always written beside them. These belong to the owner.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Out of stock shows products hidden because the store sold out. They come back on their own when restocked.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
The funnel follows people from a visit to their first switch.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.000
And launch sign-ups shows who joined, and from where.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Further down are affiliate sales, held clicks, and today's spend.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.500
Now, Needs attention. This is your to-do list.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.000
The headline count matches the badge in the menu.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Shopper requests are things shoppers asked for that we don't have yet.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Every card has one main button that takes you straight to the fix.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Brands to review are drafts that are ready to publish.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Products to approve are ready but not yet live.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Problems are live brands missing something, like a logo.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Housekeeping is for reference only. Nothing there needs you.
